@startuml SE_22_JoinQueue
title Sequence Diagram: SE_22 Tham gia hàng đợi (Join Queue)

actor "Hệ thống / Lễ tân" as System
participant "View\n(QueueManagement)" as View
participant "CheckInController" as Controller
participant "CheckInQueueService" as QueueService
participant "CheckInQueueRepository" as QueueRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

System -> View: Thêm bệnh nhân vào hàng đợi (Join Queue)
activate View
View -> Controller: joinQueue(joinQueueRequest)
activate Controller

Controller -> QueueService: processJoinQueue(patientId, roomId, appointmentId)
activate QueueService

QueueService -> QueueService: determinePriority(appointmentId)
note right: Tùy thuộc vào việc có hẹn,\nđi trễ hay bệnh nhân Returning

QueueService -> QueueRepo: findMaxQueueNumber(roomId)
activate QueueRepo
QueueRepo -> DB: SELECT MAX(queue_number) FROM check_in_queue WHERE room_id=?
activate DB
DB --> QueueRepo: currentMax
deactivate DB
QueueRepo --> QueueService: currentMax
deactivate QueueRepo

QueueService -> QueueService: build CheckInQueue entity (queueNumber = currentMax + 1)

QueueService -> QueueRepo: save(checkInQueue)
activate QueueRepo
QueueRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO check_in_queue...
activate DB
DB --> QueueRepo: success
deactivate DB
QueueRepo --> QueueService: savedQueue
deactivate QueueRepo

QueueService --> Controller: QueueResponse(queueNumber, estimatedWaitTime)
deactivate QueueService

Controller --> View: 200 OK (QueueResponse)
deactivate Controller

View --> System: Hiển thị số thứ tự & thời gian chờ
deactivate View
@enduml
